<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 24.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 24.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>No airport closures in the Commonwealth of Independent States are expected on October 25, the Russian Weather Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
